{# The set page's "Open session" button, and whether it can be pressed: only
   once a version has built. Its own partial because that changes while the
   page is open - the first build finishes under the teacher's eyes - so every
   copy of the polled status (`f-exercise-set.jinja`) carries a fresh one out
   of band. Only the button, never the form: a label being typed survives.
   The route refuses on its own either way.

   Context: `exercise_set`, `oob`. #}
<span id="exercise-session-open-button" class="flex items-center gap-3"
      {% if oob %}hx-swap-oob="true"{% endif %}>
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary"
          {% if not exercise_set.current_version_id %}disabled{% endif %}>
    <span class="submit-label">Open session</span>
    <span class="htmx-indicator loading loading-spinner loading-xs"></span>
  </button>
  {% if not exercise_set.current_version_id %}
  <span class="text-xs text-base-content/55">No version has built yet.</span>
  {% endif %}
</span>
